  "prefLabel": "Abfd 301.02 Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-12-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Abfd 301.02 Scope. Pursuant to RSA 275-C:10, II, this chapter shall apply to buildings, facilities, and their appurtenant grounds and curbs:\n\n(a) Which are used or to be used by the public; and\n\n(b) The cost of the construction, rehabilitation, or substantial remodeling of which is to be paid for, in whole or in part, by federal, state, county, or municipal funds.\n\nSource. #7347, eff 8-19-00; ss by #8011, eff 12-19-03, EXPIRED: 12-19-11\n\nNew. #10248, eff 12-22-12; ss by #13674, eff 6-23-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/abfd100-300.html"
